<title>UK: IBCA rates DSL Finance 2004 step-up notes AAA.</title>
<headline>IBCA rates DSL Finance 2004 step-up notes AAA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>IBCA, the European credit rating agency, said on Wednesday it had assigned an AAA long-term rating to the DSL Finance NV 400 million Danish crown step-up notes due 2004.</p>
<p>The issue has been guaranteed by Deutsche Siedlungs- und Landesrentenbank (DSL Bank).</p>
<p>&quot;The rating is based on the implied federal German guarantee for the obligations of DSL-bank,&quot; IBCA said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- International Bonds Unit +44 171 542 8682</p>
</text>
